Switch the corrections back on and the two paths part company, which is worth stating because the natural assumption is the opposite. Plain adds carry weight one, while the perceptron corrections in a batch fit accumulate larger weights, so as online adds pile up they gradually dilute those corrections. Measured over 670 rows on gold, the online arm scored 0.4866, the refitted arm 0.5060, and the two agreed on only 38.1 percent of rows. Neither is broken: they are different models, and a caller choosing between them should know that.
